<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drwaterbottle" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3720105); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3720105&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609878472" alt="Drwaterbottle" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3720105)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drwaterbottle" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3720105); return false;">Drwaterbottle</a></span></p>
