</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00404/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台由████公司生产的██型打印机。当使用该项目打印文本时，项目会对文本进行随机替换。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.K的办公室内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">存放于Dr.K的办公室内。</span>因Dr.K尝试对其进行维修而无效化。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>道理我都懂，可老卡你交上来一篇[数据删除]小说是什么意思？！&#8212;鱼骨</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00404" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00404" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00404-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609878472" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600832075 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">23 Sep 2020 03:34</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00440/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一对似乎曾用于盛装可饮用液体的玻璃杯。若将两个杯子同时碰撞，将会在10秒内持续发出高频率颤音。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82-γ，Piracy博士的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于站点主管的保险箱中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>好吧，这是你们第几次来拿我东西了？——Piracy博士</em><br />
<em>你哪里来的这么多异常？——站点主管C.H</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00440" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00440" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00440-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/piracyessayist-zero" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6119968); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6119968&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609878472" alt="PiracyEssayist Zero" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6119968)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/piracyessayist-zero" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6119968); return false;">PiracyEssayist Zero</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602418861 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">11 Oct 2020 12:21</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00472/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张日程表，看到该物体时会使人员忘记周末双休，并坚持认为一周之中只有周天休息。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>北京市███中学南校区布告栏上<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被研究员lush放入碎纸机之中，已查明其碎片无异常性质<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>今天是工作日吧，为什么一个人都没有啊？我现在就去向站点主任举报这群偷懒的家伙——研究员lush</em><br />
<em>为了我们的休息，lush放弃了他的双休——苍█博士</em><br />
<em>这个真是资本家的好帮手——██特工</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00472" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00472" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00472-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lush-favor" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6981514); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6981514&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609878473" alt="Lush_Favor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6981514)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lush-favor" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6981514); return false;">Lush_Favor</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1606655751 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">29 Nov 2020 13:15</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00070/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一条牛仔裤，无论何人于何时穿上这条牛仔裤，去何地，排队购买何种商品，排到他时，该商品一定断货，且该商品一天之内得不到进货。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██服装店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>特工EVIL的藏品，使用中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>不仅穿上它的人遭殃，排在他后面的人也得遭殃。</em>——特工EVIL<br />
<em>特工EVIL他爹是卖炸鸡块的，特工EVIL家对面也是卖炸鸡块的，特工EVIL为了帮他爹打败竞争对手，每天都穿上这条牛仔裤去对面买炸鸡块,这样对手就没得卖了</em>——Dr.shadeoi</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00070" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00070" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00070-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6316800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609878473" alt="Steven the shadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6316800)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;">Steven the shadow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587091447 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">17 Apr 2020 02:44</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支原产于比利时的FN FNC突击步枪，只有在弹匣井内插有巧克力块时才能射出子弹。若插入正常弹匣，则项目只会射出5.56×45mm子弹形状的巧克力。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>武警部队特种警察大队██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██异常武器收容单元<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>射出的巧克力吃起来特别甜。</em>——Dr. Kleiner</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00398" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00398-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5232386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609878473" alt="Kayo_Kesr_Aquas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5232386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;">Kayo_Kesr_Aquas</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600577702 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Sep 2020 04:55</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
    
